<title>USA: West Palm Beach, Fla. set for June 19.</title>
<headline>West Palm Beach, Fla. set for June 19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dunlap &amp; Associates, Inc., announces the following:</p>
<p>Sealed Bid:  City of West Palm Beach, Florida, $9.960 million 		 revenue bonds on</p>
<p>		 June 19 per Official Notice of Bond Sale</p>
<p>Issuer:	City of West Palm Beach, Florida</p>
<p>Description: Public Service Tax Refunding Bonds, Series 1997 Selling</p>
<p>(Bid Date):  June 19     Time: 11:00 A.M. EDST</p>
<p>Delivery</p>
<p>Date:	  July 9</p>
<p>Financial</p>
<p>Advisor:     Dunlap &amp; Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>Phone:	 (407) 849-0030</p>
</text>
